   179	**Totals:** 60 chapters, 300,000 words. The first third (≈100,000) ends inside Movement 4 (around chapter 20). The middle third ends at the close of Movement 6 (chapter 40, ≈197,000).
   180	
   181	**Quiet-movement statement:** Movement 4 is the book's one deliberately partial-quiet movement. Its tension is legal and bodily: a [SHATTERED] body enters a Compact city whose top holds a station. Its learning encounter is the reading inward (the instrument fails). Its physical load is labour: four hands, three tiers, two gates, a bad knee and a box. It may carry one small physical beat of the author's choosing, but it does not need a fight. Every other movement has at least one fight, set piece or learning bout.
