   104	| **The cut** (stillhounds; Iron Wall's first showing) | S4, ~1,800 | 3,500–4,000 plus a scouting scene | Iron Wall's limit must be taught here (rooted, loud, the man is the plane's foot) before the alley pays it off. The crew's silent doctrine is re-taught to a man who has only ever stood. |
   105	| **The alley** (the stepped cut, six faceless) | S12, ~2,400 | 4,000 | The corridor rewards the wall the road punished. Cael learns "being the reason" from inside it. The acquisition minute needs its long, quiet middle. |
