   465	- **The tall man [B7-reconciled 2026-10-11: M1 audit; OWNER-pending #59] says nothing to any of the six** until her question at the pass. **The broad man says nothing to them** until "Aye" (305th). **The older healer never speaks to them.** **The young one's name is never written** (said once, by the broad man, in the stream-bed). [OWNER-pending #54]
   466	- **"Noted" adoption:** Vastin's first is the 298th (the grade); Teague's first is the 303rd (the crest); Oryn's "Everybody says that now" comes on the 304th.
   467	- **Vastin** takes no order without walking it back before Millrace's "Stand there". He does not sit in front of the crew between the cut and the road's last post (281st).
   468	- **Cleon** is above ground with the crew only once (the yard fire). Otherwise he is at noon at his tavern, or on the stair. He takes no notice of Cael until he is told.
