   471	- **The square and the station steps:** Cael never sets foot on them. He never looks at the crown except at the count-of-one.
   472	- **Cleon's name** is first heard by Cael on the 280th. **Treswick and the Deepstacks** are first spoken aloud at the 268th table.
   473	- **Karis cannot read the index as a grade** until the 298th. The leaf is not readable on the page before the seventh day of Cleon's week.
