   287	- **Vastin's physical state and status.** Brown frieze coat, ash stick, bad knee, raw hands and a left hand that does not open flat; no age; no Iron Wall shown; not joined and has asked only for a bed (`manuscript/chapter-08.md:197–201`; `manuscript/chapter-09.md:115–143,187–191`; `manuscript/chapter-10.md:231–271`; `manuscript/chapter-11.md:19–23`). He sleeps in the loft over the tap, up the keeper's stair, after beginning the climb fast and finishing slowly (`manuscript/chapter-10.md:263–271`; `manuscript/chapter-12.md:193–219,297`).
