   106	
   107	They would not have turned. He could have made himself as loud as he pleased, here, at the wall's end, and it would have altered nothing whatever. The sound that they wanted was here already, and he would only have been adding to it. Seven hounds were trying to get round a wall. Not one of the seven had any wish to go through it. Why should it? Everything that it had come for was standing at the end.
